    "sharedInstructionsHtml": "<section class=\"source-page-card question-shared-instructions\" data-question-shared-instructions><div class=\"page-kicker\">全大問共通</div><h2>2025年度 一般選抜 物理</h2><p class=\"prose\">一般選抜A：2科目 120分　一般選抜B：60分</p></section>",
